        "original_id": "562eb6d0-5951-5e4a-b827-42cb04654047",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wayne Coyne, Robert Palmer, Mark Coyne\n- Organizations: The Flaming Lips\n- Products: Hear It Is\n- Roles: Lead singer, backing vocalist, guitarist, keyboardist, theremin player, songwriter\n- Concepts: Musical styles, vocal debut\n\nFacts:\n- Wayne Coyne became the vocalist on Hear It Is after his brother Mark Coyne departed.\n- Wayne Coyne is the lead singer, occasional backing vocalist, guitarist, keyboardist, theremin player, and songwriter for The Flaming Lips.\n- Robert Palmer was known for his distinctive, soulful voice.\n- Robert Palmer was known for an eclectic mix of musical styles on his albums, combining soul, jazz, rock, pop, reggae, and blues.\n- Robert Palmer was also known for sartorial acumen.",
